<t>09/27/2026</t>
<h>AniList Integrations V2: Technical Release Notes</h>
<d>Shared community cache and watchlist update</d>
<b>Local AL cache is seeded from a shared Cloudflare KV store that routinely gets dumped to GitHub, then updated weekly.
Currently cached for ~500 titles (from the last ~10 days of activity): AniList ID, status, banner, trailer.
No TTL -> Missing banner or trailer (if sourced from the GitHub import) triggers a background full refetch, then a PUT to Cloudflare.
Live episode schedule is not stored in shared cache -> If a title status was marked airing in shared, the script does an airing-refresh for next EP airing date (and PUT to cloudflare if AniList now reports the show finished).
Delicious settings: Clear All AniList Cache and Import Shared Cache from GitHub.
Download latest episode on each watchlist entry (via AnimeBytes API). Username/passkey auto-detected from the site; strict match by AB group ID and/or MAL ID.
Discuss links to the [Airing] forum thread (same logic as the standalone discuss script).
Fix: Episode badge shows the current (last aired) episode, not the upcoming one.
QOL change: Title click goes to the AB torrent group page instead of AniList. Card layout now consistently aligned.</b>
